# YELLOW: an independent audit and a verdict on every ledger row. RED: that, plus Michael's approval at the
# head sha (`trk review record`; see spec 03's 2026-10-11 amendment for a repo with no GitHub remote).

# The map decides who reviews, so changing it is reviewed by Michael.
RED .trk/blast-radius
